DexSwapModuleFactory_Constructor
├── when the router is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModuleFactory_ZeroRouter
├── when the router has no deployed code
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModuleFactory_RouterNotContract
└── when the router is a valid contract
    ├── it should set the router
    ├── it should set the sequencer uptime feed
    ├── it should set the sequencer grace period
    └── it should accept a zero sequencer feed for the L1 profile
